      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: saddle_up_boys!!!; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two men in cowboy attire riding horses with a dog in a grassy field under a blue sky, with the text 'saddle up boys!!!' and 'time too play cowboys'. The overall intent is to evoke a lighthearted, nostalgic, or playful cowboy theme. There is no evidence of toxicity, abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda content. The meme is harmless and intended for entertainment or humor, using the visual of cowboys to match the playful text. The scene is non-threatening and does not target any specific group or community with harmful stereotypes or slurs. The intent is to create a fun, relatable, or nostalgic mood, possibly encouraging viewers to engage in cowboy-themed activities or reminisce about Western imagery. No harmful or toxic elements are present.",
