      "label": "User projected onto the playful cowboy theme",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the overall scene and textual message, which invites them to participate in the 'play cowboys' activity. The text 'saddle up boys!!!' and 'time too play cowboys' creates an inclusive, participatory tone, suggesting the user is part of the group or invited to join the fun. This projection is onto the Scene entity 'cowboys_riding_horses' and the TextualMaterial 'text_chunk' (top text), as the user is implicitly invited to imagine themselves as part of this cowboy scenario.",
